  "document_title": "IEEE Std 802.3df-2024 — IEEE Standard for Ethernet Amendment: Physical Layer Specifications and Management Parameters for 800 Gb/s Operation (and 400 Gb/s and 800 Gb/s PHYs using 100 Gb/s lanes), with cross-references to the IEEE 802.3 Clause-4 MAC frame format and the MAC/RS/PCS/PMA/PMD layered architecture",
  "version": "IEEE Std 802.3df-2024 (approved 16 February 2024) — 800GBASE PHY family using 100 Gb/s electrical lanes (8x100G or 4x200G); companion IEEE P802.3dj (1.6 Tb/s + 200 Gb/s/lane PHYs, targeted completion July 2026)",
