    "800GMII (800 Gb/s Media-Independent Interface, logical) — MAC↔PCS reconciliation; carries the 800 Gb/s MAC byte stream into the PCS (implemented internally; no exposed parallel pin bus at 800G).",
    "Electrical-lane interface (AUI-class, e.g. 800GAUI-8 C2M/C2C): 8 differential TX pairs + 8 differential RX pairs of 100 Gb/s each (PAM4, 106.25 GBd), OR 800GAUI-4 with 4 lanes of 200 Gb/s.",
    "PMD service interface to the medium: 8-lane MMF/SMF parallel-fiber ribbon (DR8/SR8/VR8) or 8 wavelengths / 2x4-wavelength CWDM (2xFR4) on single-mode fiber.",
    "MDC / MDIO Clause-45 management bus (5-bit PRTAD + 5-bit DEVAD + 16-bit register) — 800G PHYs are managed exclusively via Clause-45 MMDs (PMA/PMD=1, PCS=3, AN=7); no Clause-22 register file.",
    "Reference clock + reset + low-speed sideband (per AUI / module form-factor, e.g. OSFP / QSFP-DD800)."
  ],
